WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.610
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:11.740
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:17.990
Venus Ark departed from Japan to travel the Pacific Ocean on their cruise tour.

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:22.250
The rest of us returned to Four Star Academy, our time studying abroad over.

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:30.090
We brought back with us lots of memories, irreplaceable experiences, and best of all, Koharu-chan.

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:35.300
I can finally do Aikatsu with Koharu-chan at Four Star again!

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.800
I can't contain my excitement and anticipation!

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.320
I overslept a bit since the seagulls aren't here to wake me.

00:00:58.410 --> 00:00:59.910
I'm really back.

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:03.080
Here at Four Star Academy.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.460
What you do with those abilities...

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:08.880
...is entirely up to you.

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:20.010
<i>I wonder how Yume-chan will react.</i>

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:23.430
I've gotta hurry!

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:30.690
<i>When I tell her that I want to help design a dress for her brand, Berry Parfait...</i>

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:34.900
Yume-chan!

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:36.820
Good morning!

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:41.120
Good morning. I was just on my way out to meet you.

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:42.870
We both couldn't wait!

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:46.330
Ready to head out?

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:47.500
Sure!

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:29.520
It's been so long since we've come out here together.{longhood}

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:32.230
Right? Let's have a good time!

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:47.910
Hopefully Kirara-chan gets back with Elza-san all right.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:49.250
Yeah.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:51.750
We sure bought a lot.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:53.920
It was so fun I couldn't help it.

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:00.840
Look, the Aikatsu Ranking got updated.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.010
Really?

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:05.140
Who's this girl?

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:07.640
Futaba Aria-chan?

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:12.310
It seems like she's starting to get a lot of attention overseas.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:13.560
Overseas?!

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:17.650
Too many amazing people are out there...

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:20.530
Don't say that! You're just as amazing!

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:26.780
You almost made it to the top of the ranking that used to be filled with Venus Ark idols!

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.740
You really think so?

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:30.540
Of course.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:34.670
I know you'll be the first star one day.

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.630
Thanks, Koharu-chan!

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:42.550
But the one thing I need first is a Star Premium Rare Coord...

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:46.340
What is it that I'm lacking?

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:48.600
A sense for design.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:56.060
I'm fairly confident in my ability to perform on stage...

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.270
Say, Yume-chan.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.320
Listen...

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:03.690
If you'd be all right with it...

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:06.070
I'd like to help—

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:10.580
Hey, wait!

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.080
My hat!

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:15.410
Huh? Nijino Yume-chan?

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:16.580
Oh, yes.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.460
What? From S4?

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:20.090
It's really her!

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:28.930
Catch our Best of S4 album, Stars Shower!

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:31.010
Now on sale!

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:33.810
Um, could I have your autograph?

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:36.940
Of course! Please continue to support me.

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:41.520
Oh! I just remembered, Koharu-chan.

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:45.530
What was it you were trying to tell me at the café?

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:50.660
Right, that! So listen, if you don't mind, I want to help Berry Parfait—

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:53.040
Ah, it's Nijino-senpai!

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:54.870
I bought your "Best of" album!{there has to be a way to make this less weird-looking}{good enough}

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:54.870
Nijino-senpai!

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:56.210
Please train us!

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:59.960
Oh yeah, the second semester's already started.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.960
Senpai, we're counting on you!

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.960
Thanks, everyone.

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:15.310
Okay. I can finally hear what you were trying to say, Koharu-chan.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.480
Never mind. It was nothing.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.230
Koharu-chan?

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:32.370
"25th Generation S4 Members! A Surprise Party to Welcome Your Return"?

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:34.240
Interested? {timing}

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:42.130
Hime-senpai and the others are co-starring in a drama, and afterwards they'll be returning here.

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:49.930
The current S4 decided to take the lead in holding a surprise party to welcome them back.

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:55.890
But everything here only has you as the leader.

00:06:55.890 --> 00:07:01.900
Yeah. Yuzu-senpai is being celebrated, 
and both Mahiru-chan and Ako-chan are busy.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:08.570
I'm the only one who's free next 
Thursday afternoon to set up for the party.

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:10.150
What about Rola and the rest?

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:14.910
Well, they're still cleaning up the last of the Aikatsu Island stuff.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:18.370
But you're already so occupied with S4 work.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:23.250
Plus you've been thinking about your dress designs—
how will you manage to prepare for the party?

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:26.050
I'll make sure to see it through until the end.

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:31.840
I'm looking forward to showing the previous S4 how much I've grown.

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:33.220
Yume-chan...

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:35.640
Yume-chan!

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:36.930
Yuzu-senpai?

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:40.940
Whoa! I'm lucky I caught you together...

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:44.440
Did you need something, Yuzu-senpai?

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:48.610
Yeah! The headmaster wants to see you two!

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:51.200
Huh? The headmaster does?

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:52.410
Me too?

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:55.870
What?

00:07:55.870 --> 00:08:00.290
You want me to be a guest heroine on the musical period drama "Japanese Sweets Quartet"? {hmm}

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:03.750
A musical period drama? But isn't that...

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.960
Yes, the one we're in.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:11.590
You'll be playing our Japanese Sweets Quartet's dear housemaid who provides us with advice on kimonos. {tanmono is this specific word that refers to the cloth/textiles. }

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.880
It's the perfect role for you!

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:19.350
It's so incredible that your first job back is getting to work alongside our senpai!

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:20.600
Yeah!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:21.980
As for you, Nijino.

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:23.270
Y-Yes!

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:28.440
You have received an offer to star in Let's Go Curry's commercial for their new summer dishes.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:31.780
Let's Go Curry?

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:37.070
They're a curry chain famous for their rich roux and generous portions of toppings.

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:42.540
The smell wafting out of their shops is a dieter's worst enemy.

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:47.670
Yuzu's favorite is the triple tonkatsu fried shrimp with piles of cabbage!

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:51.550
Eating it always gives me the brightest smile ever!

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.720
What a gig, Yume-chan!

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:54.800
Thanks.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:57.300
Filming will be Thursday next week.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:08:59.350
Do us proud.

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:02.980
I will!

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:09.980
It's really too bad that it overlaps with the surprise party.

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:13.440
But you can't complain since it's for work.

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:16.410
It'll work out.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.660
I won't just give up!

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:29.000
I'll make sure the party's a success and have Hime-senpai feel that leaving S4 to me was the right choice.

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:31.130
Yume-chan...

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:45.020
<i>You surprised me...</i>

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:47.520
<i>Yume-chan.</i>

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:51.360
<i>You handle everything with such ease.</i>

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:54.030
<i>There's no need for my help...</i>

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.660
This is our new product.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:00.830
Curry ice with a mountain of summer veggies!

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:05.450
So it's not... curry rice...

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:06.620
But curry...

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:08.290
Ice!

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:12.420
Our company is associated with steaming-hot food,

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:16.470
but with the summer heat, it's holding back our sales.

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:22.220
We developed this curry to turn our weakness into a strength!

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:24.180
And it's not rice...

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:25.850
It's ice!

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:33.730
Among everyone in S4, you have the most contagious smile—

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:38.360
With your help, everyone who eats our curry ice will surely show a hot smile...

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:45.580
I suppose that pairing curry and ice really isn't...

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:46.750
Please leave it to me.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:52.170
I'll use the fullest extent of my power to exceed your expectations!

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:59.090
I'd like to introduce you to today's 
special guest, Nanakura Koharu-san!

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:01.890
Th-Thank you for inviting me!

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:10.810
<i>I wonder how Yume-chan's commercial is going.</i>

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:15.520
<i>Stop. She doesn't need me worrying about her.</i>

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:17.780
Let's run a test shoot!

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:19.240
<i>Okay!</i>

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:23.950
A new type of ice that'll set your mouth on fire!

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:25.950
Let's Go Curry Ice!

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:27.490
Cut!

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:30.080
Absolutely fantastic, Nijino-san!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.750
Thank you.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:36.300
<i>Perfect, there's still plenty of time to prepare for the surprise party.</i>

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:40.010
By the way, could we request that you do a different version too?

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:43.550
We really don't want to neglect one of our company's top toppings.

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:46.680
So here it is, hamburg curry ice!

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:02.070
And we're clear!

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:07.200
<i>I hope Yume-chan is okay.</i>

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.160
Your acting is flawless.

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:16.840
But we want to express more than just the depth of the period, but also the breadth of the times...{okay uh}{he says it}

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:19.170
A connection with the world at large.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:22.590
It sounds like you want it to be more all over the place.

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:26.970
What if we expand beyond Japanese treats,

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:30.140
and make sweets from all around the world into princesses?

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:32.430
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:34.400
I didn't mean to butt in.

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:35.730
I like it.

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:42.400
But if we move in that direction, we'll need to completely change the wardrobe from traditional Edo garb.

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:45.860
I don't think we have time to find an expert on world fashion.{it's not just western}{can't really see much video without talking}

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:50.490
In that case, why not rely on Koharu-chan?

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:51.080
Huh?

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:59.750
Good idea! She was even scouted by Elza-chan for her talent in design while she was doing Aikatsu in Italy.

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:02.420
By Perfect Elza?

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:04.130
Yes.

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:09.930
Can we count on you?

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:11.220
Of course.

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:15.310
Ready, action!

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:19.690
A new type of ice that'll set your mouth on fire!

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:22.480
Let's Go Hamburg Curry Ice!

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.070
Cut!

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:27.870
Next is the cream croquette curry ice.

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:28.780
Got it.

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:50.850
Cut! It's a masterpiece!

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:59.270
Here, this is the last one.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:07.320
Let's call it a wrap. We can't thank you enough.

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:13.490
Your hard work will surely bring smiles to all of our customers.

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.830
Thank you, you're too kind.

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:20.580
<i>I should still have just enough time to prepare the party.</i>

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:24.670
Isn't that...

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:30.180
Yuzu's favorite is the triple tonkatsu fried shrimp with piles of cabbage!

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:34.260
Eating it always gives me the brightest smile ever!

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:40.020
No, they might not be getting the greatest smiles they can yet!

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:43.520
I'll do one more!

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:49.530
With the triple tonkatsu fried shrimp with piles of cabbage curry ice!

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:52.530
What? Yume-chan's not back yet?

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:54.700
Yes, that's right.

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:58.120
She told us she had something to talk about.

00:14:58.120 --> 00:14:59.920
Do you know anything?

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:05.090
Oh? That's the face of someone who knows exactly what it is.

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:07.420
Well...

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:13.930
Nijino-san worked really hard on this surprise.

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:20.520
I see. Then whey don't we start working while we wait for her?

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:28.190
The moment we decided to prepare our own 
surprise party, you can say the surprise was a success.

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:29.950
Please wait.

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:35.160
Yume-chan said she wanted to do this herself no matter what.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:40.210
She was looking forward to showing you all how much she's grown.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:44.960
I'm worried she'll be disappointed if you helped out.

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:47.170
Yume-chan isn't that kind of girl.

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:55.640
That's something you should know better than anyone.

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:00.810
She doesn't shine simply for herself.

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:07.900
She has a radiance meant for illuminating the smiles of the boundless people surrounding her.

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:11.490
That's why I entrusted S4 to her.

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:24.040
That part of Yume-chan hasn't changed one bit since before you left Four Star Academy.

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:29.130
Nijino-san, we really can't thank you enough!

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.130
That was a superb smile!

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.050
It was all due to you.

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:35.800
Thank you, everyone!

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:41.020
<i>It's a lot later than I'd hoped.</i>

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:45.310
<i>But if I were to abandon a job for the party,</i>

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:49.480
<i>Hime-senpai and everyone else wouldn't be able to enjoy it.</i>

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:02.410
Yume-chan...

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:04.670
I'm so glad.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:09.210
Thanks so much, Koharu-chan!

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:18.890
Welcome back!

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:32.730
Such a lovely reverie.

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:36.700
We can't be the only ones on the receiving end.

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:40.450
They'd better get ready for a mind-blowing present.

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:43.000
Yes. In return, we'll give them...

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:45.500
Our greatest performance!

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:51.120
Both them and their Shine Stars Coords are wonderful.

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:58.300
Their stars are a different four colors from our S4, 
shining at the center of their universe on stage. {too much of everything}

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:04.220
My, you came to watch, Aria-chan? {aw shit son, new main character}

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:07.930
Fantastic... you were so fantastic! {I don't have anything for her yet, but she seems fairy like}{this is probably}

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:11.730
I really do love Hime-chan's Aikatsu most of all!

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:19.150
Their performance was so amazing.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:20.110
Yeah.

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:23.490
I'm really lucky.

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:30.950
My dream to get into S4 has given me the chance to be here right now.

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:38.460
You've grown beautiful. You're so much brighter than when we parted that I can hardly see.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:44.220
So much so that sometimes I feel you're forever out of my reach.

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:49.510
I've felt scared ever since we reunited.

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:52.770
Since I saw how hard you were working.

00:20:53.390 --> 00:21:00.650
That day, I might've been the one who left Four Star, but before I realized it,

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:03.820
you seemed to be the one who left me.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.670
It's warm.

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:22.670
Tell me. What was it you wanted to say at the café?

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:28.090
Okay. Back then, I... I really...

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:31.560
I love you.

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:34.600
From the bottom of my heart.

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:37.400
I really love you. I love you so much.

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:42.780
For you, I will step forward on my own feet.

00:21:44.190 --> 00:21:47.780
I'll take hold of my dream. I'll get closer to my dream.

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:53.080
I want to help with Berry Parfait's design!

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:58.830
I want to walk together down the path that leads your brand to the star-filled sky!

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:01.960
That's everything I wanted to say to you!

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:08.130
Let's go together until the end of time.

00:22:08.130 --> 00:22:12.470
We'll unfurl the wings of our Berry Parfait.

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:14.980
With Koharu-chan!

00:22:15.350 --> 00:22:17.480
With Yume-chan!

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:20.480
Until we reach our first star!

00:23:56.080 --> 00:23:59.120
When Yozora-senpai and the others wear the Shine Stars Coord,

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:01.580
they're so radiant even the dresses seem happy!

00:24:01.580 --> 00:24:03.420
They're our goal to strive towards.

00:24:03.420 --> 00:24:06.540
And one day, we've gotta surpass them!

00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:09.260
Let's aim for it together!

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:13.220
Yume and Koharu are fighting?!

00:24:13.220 --> 00:24:15.510
Geez, it's not like that!

00:24:15.510 --> 00:24:18.350
They say fights are a sign of closeness.

00:24:18.350 --> 00:24:20.230
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.230 --> 00:24:21.770
Rainbow dress.{I miss the days of the ever-present "ichigo means strawberry" TL note}

00:24:21.770 --> 00:24:24.150
Become the first-star idol!
